{"ver": "0.1", "info": {"id": "ldSfD3", "date": "1502433009", "viewed": 486, "name": "BubbleVerse 152 chars", "username": "coyote", "description": "So much happening in first 15 seconds with so few characters. :)\n\nBased on phenomenal [url]https://www.shadertoy.com/view/MsjfDK[/url]", "likes": 6, "published": 3, "flags": 0, "usePreview": 0, "tags": ["2d", "short", "tweet"], "hasliked": 0, "parentid": "", "parentname": ""}, "renderpass": [{"inputs": [], "outputs": [{"id": "4dfGRr", "channel": 0}], "code": "//practically the same as benoitM's https://www.shadertoy.com/view/MsjfDK\n//only differences are the constants and swizzling\n\n//define mainImage does not work anymore.\n//well, it was nice while it lasted...\nvoid mainImage( out vec4 o, vec2 u ) {\n    o = 20.*vec4((u+u-(o.xy=iResolution.xy))/o.y, iTime*.1,0);\n    for(int i=0; i++ < 33;)               \\\n        o.wxzy = abs( o/dot(o,o) - vec4(.8,.2,.01,.4) );\n}\n\n//136 chars by Fabrice\n/*\nvoid mainImage(out vec4 o, vec2 u){                                         \\\n    o.xy = 20.*(u+u- (o.xy=iResolution.xy) )/o.y,\n     o.z = 2. * iTime;\n    for(int i=0; i++ < 33;)\n        o.wxzy = abs( o/dot(o,o) - .1*vec4(8,2,.1,4) );}           /*\n\n//original 138\n\n#define mainImage( o, u )                   \\\n    o = 20.*vec4((u+u-(o.xy=iResolution.xy))/o.y, iTime*.1,0); \\\n    for(int i=0; i++ < 33;)               \\\n        o.wxzy = abs( o/dot(o,o) - vec4(.8,.2,.01,.4) )\n\n/**/", "name": "Image", "description": "", "type": "image"}]}